#: rc.cpp:1
msgid "Thumbnail of the current snapshot"
msgstr "Imådjete del waitroûlêye do moumint"

#: rc.cpp:2
msgid ""
"This is a thumbnail of the current snapshot.\\n\\nThe image can be dragged "
"to another application or document to copy the full screenshot there. Try it "
"with the Konqueror file manager!"
msgstr ""
"Çouchal est ene imådjete del waitroûlêye do moumint.\\n"
"\\n"
"Vos l' poloz haetchî viè èn ôte programe ou documint po-z î copyî li "
"waitroûlêye en etir. Sayîz avou l' manaedjeu di fitchîs Konqueror!"

#: rc.cpp:3
msgid "&New"
msgstr "&Novea"

#: rc.cpp:4
msgid "Alt+N"
msgstr "Alt+N"

#: rc.cpp:5
msgid "Save &As..."
msgstr "Schaper eyet r&lomer..."

#: rc.cpp:6
msgid "Alt+A"
msgstr "Alt+L"

#: rc.cpp:8
msgid "Alt+S"
msgstr "Alt+S"

#: rc.cpp:10
msgid "Alt+P"
msgstr "Alt+P"

#: rc.cpp:12
msgid " sec"
msgstr " seg"

#: rc.cpp:13
msgid "No delay"
msgstr "Nou tårdjaedje"

#: rc.cpp:14
msgid "Snapshot delay in seconds"
msgstr "Li tårdjaedje divant d' prinde li waitroûlêye, e segondes"

#: rc.cpp:15
msgid ""
"<qt>\\nThis is the number of seconds to wait after clicking the <i>New "
"Snapshot</i> button before taking the snapshot.\\n"
"<p>\\nThis is very useful for getting windows, menus and other items on the "
"screen set up just the way you want.\\n"
"<p>\\nIf <i>no delay</i> is set, the program will wait for a mouse click "
"before taking a snapshot.\\n</p>\\n</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>\\n"
"Çouchal c' est li nombe di segondes a tårdjî après aveur clitchî sol "
"boton <i>Novele waitroûlêye</i> po kel waitroûlêye soeye fwaite.\\n"
"<p>\\n"
"C' est foirt ahessåve po mete les purneas, menus ou ôtes cayets come vos "
"l' voloz sol waitroûle.\\n"
"<p>\\n"
"Si <i>nou tårdjaedje</i> n' est dné, li programe va ratinde ki vos "
"clitchîz avou l' sori divant d' prinde li waitroûlêye.\\n"
"</p>\\n"
"</qt>"

#: rc.cpp:16
msgid "Snapshot &delay:"
msgstr "&Tårdjaedje pol waitroûlêye:"

#: rc.cpp:17
msgid "Cap&ture mode:"
msgstr "&Môde po les waitroûlêyes:"

#: rc.cpp:18
msgid "Include &window decorations"
msgstr "Les gåliotaedjes do &purnea avou"

#: rc.cpp:19
msgid "Alt+W"
msgstr "Alt+P"

#: rc.cpp:20
msgid "When enabled, snapshot of a window will also include the window decorations"
msgstr ""
"Tchoezixhoz çouchal si vos vloz eto les gåliotaedjes do purnea (båre di "
"tite, boirdeures) dins l' waitroûlêye"

#: rc.cpp:21
msgid "Full Screen"
msgstr "Waitroûle erire"

#: rc.cpp:22
msgid "Window Under Cursor"
msgstr "Purnea dizo l' cursoe"

#: rc.cpp:23
msgid "Region"
msgstr "Redjon"

